Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Without a capacity limit, target K of two produces the same partition and cutsize three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}没有容量限制时，目标 K 为二仍得到相同分组，割边权重总和为三。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}With capacity two, the result has three clusters and cutsize eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量为二时，结果有三个簇，割边权重总和为八。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:17.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The difference of five comes exactly from A to C and B to C becoming cross-cluster edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:17.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}多出的五，恰好来自 A 到 C 和 B 到 C 两条边变成跨簇边。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:24.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}If target K is three instead, that same capacity-two result successfully reaches the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:24.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}如果目标 K 改为三，那么同一个容量为二的结果就成功达到目标。
